Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是图妮·贝维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toni Bevell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者 伦敦分会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters, London Chapterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派我来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent me to take you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下 - 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the gun down. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都知道你是不会扣下扳机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know you're not gonna pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我我最需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me what I needed most.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给予你同样的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:30.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}really…real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特 你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester. I'm your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的迪恩才四岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Dean is 4 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死的时候我是四岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was when you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy. Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫玛丽·桑德拉·坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name … your name is Mary Sandra Campbell, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生于1954年12月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born December 5, 1954,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母是萨穆埃尔和迪安娜·坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Samuel and Deanna Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲为了工作四处漂泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father, he bounced around a lot for, uh, work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一直跟随他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you bounced right along with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后你在堪萨斯州劳伦斯落脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you ended up in Lawrence, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:02:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,1972年3月23日\N{\fnArial\fs30}March 23, 1972,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走出了一家电影院\N{\fnArial\fs30}you walked out of a movie theater …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,刚看完《第五屠宰场》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Slaughterhouse-Five."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你超喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撞上了一个大块头海军陆战队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you bumped into a big Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他撞倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you knocked him flat on his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得很不好意思 他却一笑而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were embarrassed, and he laughed it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你请他喝杯咖啡就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}said you could make it up to him with a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你们去了穆罗尼餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you went to, uh, Mulroney's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们聊了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道每首齐柏林飞船的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he knew the words to every Zeppelin song,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他要你电话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}so when he asked you for your number,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就给了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gave it to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你知道你爸会气坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though you knew your dad would be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一晚 你遇见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the night that … that you met …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,1975年8月19日 你们结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}August 19, 1975, you were married…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雷诺结的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Reno.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年后 我就出生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years later, I came along,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我烧死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,33年\N{\fnArial\fs30}33 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离堪萨斯州的黎巴嫩有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far am I from Lebanon, Kansas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-three hours, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是谁…你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait. Who … What are you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了我牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave himself up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like John.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成了猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was a Hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你和萨姆也培养成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he raised you and Sam to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们以前见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said we've met before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你时空旅行的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you traveled through time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记忆被抹去了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your memory got wiped, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做鬼的时候还见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw you when I was a ghost…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我也不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I don't remember, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的妹妹把我复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God's…sister brought me back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是挺难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know it's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会解释一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll explain everything. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷戈里·马里恩医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Gregory Marion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.45,0:08:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才早上六点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … It's 6:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家后屋有座诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a clinic at the back of your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该物品齐全吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust it's fully stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady. Lady, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你的狗狗被车撞了还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless your uh … your puggle got hit by a car or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不急这一时\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他腿部中了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was shot in the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.57,0:08:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪 .38子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single, .38-caliber bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把子弹挖出来 缝好伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the round dug out, the wound sutured,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我点麻醉带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some anesthesia to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是兽医\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a veterinarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物 人 都是肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animals, people. They're all meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道 这是个不情之请\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I understand this is an unusual request,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力缓解你的不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want to do everything I can to ease your concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也觉得这蠢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is stupid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think when Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗王子 地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince of Darkness, King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}asks you to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就照办\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是14岁少女吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a 14-year-old girl now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我附身过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I possessed one once,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 并不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}but … Pbht … it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多思绪 冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of feelings and urges.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭起来鼻涕眼泪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ugly snot crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么朱莉跟克雷格·卡塞尔在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how Julie's with Craig Castle now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他是个帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though he's total bae,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她则是个贱婊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's, like, a busted bitch on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷尔蒙 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hormones, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了 赶紧收拾干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Let's clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we go meet the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 亲爱的 妈妈很快就会回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, darling. But mommy will be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,图妮·贝维尔 伦敦分会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toni Bevell, London Chapterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格兰的记录者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, uh, English Men of Letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不列颠\N{\fnArial\fs30}British.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在想等我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wondering how far I'm gonna have to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要走多远才能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to town after I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过先杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你把我们都杀掉之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, before you murder us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有几个问题问你 关于你 你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do have a few questions about you, your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters in America,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.75,0:11:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及你们是如何拯救太阳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how you saved the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你开枪打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. You shoot me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架我\N{\fnArial\fs30}kidnap me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是乐意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but yeah, happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想伤害你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:11:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然可以说本不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could say it was never supposed to go this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是…你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're…you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本就是不可避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always going to go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你了解我吗 - 我们了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you know me? - We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们观察你和你哥哥多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been watching you and your brother for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你们第一次险些毁灭世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every since you almost ended the world the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还知道路西法 天使坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew all about Lucifer, the angels falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们当时在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些人是想插手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, some of us wanted to get involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老头子们不许\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the old men wouldn't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得我们那样就过界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we were overstepping our bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但经过了黑暗的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all this business with the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连他们也承认 事情得有所改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}even they have to agree, things need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虽然不信 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while you might not believe this, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I-I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为把你锁起来道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to apologize for locking you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有危险 对自己和他人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dangerous … to others and yourself …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you answer my questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能走出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you walk right out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 免了 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pass. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你问我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can ask me any kind of question you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's gonna be the exact same …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我动手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被魔鬼本人折磨过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tortured by the Devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 不过是口音加裤套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you, you're just an accent in a pantsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷水澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cold shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your play?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不在外面忙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when we're not on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是记录者的地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old Men of Letters bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记录者 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Men of Letters? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是猎人的老故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old Hunter's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,新行头挺好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}New duds look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比穿着睡衣到处走好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than walking around in that nightgown the rest …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air. Get on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 萨姆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, and where is Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是友军\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你活着 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're alive? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹和黑暗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the bomb and the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你一切的 萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you everything. Where is Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a Hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我是天使 - 他是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm an angel. - He's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使 天打头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Angel, with a-a capital "A."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,翅膀 竖琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, wings, harp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有竖琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have a harp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 这是玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, this is…Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妈妈 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your mother? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 萨姆哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait, uh, where … where is Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不回电话 地板上又有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not answering his phone, there's blood on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来时 有个女人等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came back here, there was a woman waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我炸飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She blasted me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道萨姆去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,地堡里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, the bunker's empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们显然是走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so … so they've obviously left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说女人 不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said woman … not an angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是恶魔 是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a demon, a-a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did this go down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌晨2：12\N{\fnArial\fs30}2:12 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a-a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌晨2：21一辆SUV\N{\fnArial\fs30}An S.U.V. ran a red light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离这儿几个街区处闯了红灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few blocks from here at 2:21 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,40分钟内没有别的车出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there wasn't another car for 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我黑了交通监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hacked the traffic cams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是约翰的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was John's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还那么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's still beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.19,0:19:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we end this, Sam, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you imagine is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你这是勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you're being brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这里的英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're the hero of this story?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're no hero, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不擅长你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just bad at your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you're better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走乡间小路 随机处理案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive back roads, catching cases at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说有人死了 就去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get word a body's dropped, you check it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至能杀死作恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe you even kill the thing that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那人还是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that person is still dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还要多死几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们提早计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We plan ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们研究传说 利用它对付敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We study lore, and we use it against our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那儿 每条大道 每座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back home, every thoroughfare, every bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个码头 每个机场都有防护符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}every dock, ‭every airport has been warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有怪物踏入英国境内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment a monster steps foot in Britain,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟不到 他就会被我们抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within 20 minute', he's been picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.47,0:20:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,40分钟不到 他就会被干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And within 40, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国自1965年就没有怪物致死的案例了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There hasn't been a monster-related death in Britain since 1965.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们很擅长我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we are good at our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们本就没什么前途 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you were always a lost cause, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望有其他我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm hoping there are other Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,与之合作 教导的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can work with, teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.53,0:21:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你告诉我名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I need you to give me names.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址 和其他一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and locations and everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报传递点 会面地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead drops, meeting places,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织阶级\N{\fnArial\fs30}an organizational hierarchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 如果我们齐心合力\N{\fnArial\fs30}because maybe with all of us working together,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能做到你从来都做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can do what you never could …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证美国安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}make America safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 你会把他们绑在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you tie them to a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你还不如我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you do worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:21:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你可以下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you can go to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.09,0:22:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要逼我这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really gonna make me do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.95,0:22:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 你 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw…you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.91,0:23:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So, so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是要来跟我们碰面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was supposed to meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.57,0:23:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.74,0:23:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I … Of course, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here, but … but where's…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不肯告诉我他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.51,0:23:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得有人跟踪了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能被人跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.55,0:23:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.35,0:24:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在他身上下赌注呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still betting that horse, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.35,0:24:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为我们不蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause we're not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.21,0:24:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续骗自己吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep telling yourself that, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.99,0:24:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟黑暗的一番打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dustup with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定对他伤害不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}must've really taken it out of the old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才一个个地换皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he's jumping from vessel to vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.89,0:24:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}to vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.23,0:24:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以路西法在逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why Lucifer's running …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他虚弱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.35,0:24:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会强壮起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法能带我们获得荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will lead us to glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有他在 地狱就不会追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as he's out there, Hell will never follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像人说的 「净废话」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like they say, "Duh."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.78,0:24:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等我杀了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I kill the Devil …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were his dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.32,0:24:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算变弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even powered down,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也还能完爆你个装逼男\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could kick your Posh Spice ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在笑的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's laughing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.49,0:25:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eeny…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.25,0:25:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}…meeny…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.15,0:25:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}…miney…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.13,0:25:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.58,0:25:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米·罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.83,0:25:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天你开车载她的金发女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blond woman that you drove yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.46,0:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,金发女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonde?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计 你搞错了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, mate, you got the wrong …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.69,0:25:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.01,0:25:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,金发女 说名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonde. Name. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.11,0:25:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't know her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:26:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能承受那么多痛还不开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can take that much pain and not break.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.46,0:26:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I th… Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want him dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我马上就割了他的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll slit his throat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.01,0:26:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你还想再进一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to take this to the next level,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.48,0:26:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫来凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring in Mr. Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要那个疯子接近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want that psychopath anywhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.56,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.99,0:26:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.49,0:26:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再尝试击垮他的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}we stop trying to break his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.15,0:26:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是击垮他的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We break his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.61,0:27:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很难接受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be difficult for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我最初来到地球的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember my first moments on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.05,0:27:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was jarring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.87,0:27:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是跟着猎人长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up with Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过人死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of people coming back from the dead before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.52,0:27:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但自己活过来 还隔了30年\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to actually do it… after 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.72,0:27:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界已经改变了好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.70,0:27:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.23,0:27:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 查了那个谁给我们的机尾号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, ran the, uh, tail number that what's-his-face gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.49,0:28:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶女王到达时乘的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plane that Evil Elsa flew in on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.04,0:28:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,登记为外交飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}has diplomatic registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.54,0:28:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.28,0:28:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以其飞行计划是机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means its flight plans are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.33,0:28:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想黑进国务院去\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you want to hack the State Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:11.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格雷戈里·马里恩医生 兽医）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.06,0:28:16.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格雷戈里·马里恩医生 兽医诊所）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.41,0:28:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,马里恩医生 让我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Marion, how about you let us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.55,0:28:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就什么都没问 把子弹从他腿里挖出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you dug the bullet out of his leg, no questions asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了我10万块\N{\fnArial\fs30}She offered me 100 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you took it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,学生贷款是很重的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Student loans were a bitch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.40,0:28:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 小卡 别伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Cass! Cass! Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.33,0:28:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不到时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.65,0:28:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}she didn't give me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完事后 司机走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were done, the driver bailed,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.69,0:28:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有另一个小妞过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then some other chick shows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一起开走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they all drive away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.98,0:29:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's everything you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.49,0:29:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.91,0:29:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.29,0:29:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有她的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have her phone number!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.39,0:29:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Okay, look, look, look.Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.18,0:29:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她几小时前打给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she called me a couple hours ago …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.48,0:29:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few hours ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.44,0:29:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我给他打的镇定剂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking about the sedative I gave the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我有她的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…I've got her phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.68,0:30:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.94,0:30:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 他就会求着回答我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, he'll be begging to answer our questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能让那停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything to make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.30,0:30:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,马里恩医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Marion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.55,0:30:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm just calling, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问病人情况的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to, uh, check on the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.51,0:30:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, sure. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.06,0:30:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hanging up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.27,0:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.43,0:30:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你是谁 我不管你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who you are, I don't care what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.53,0:30:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓了我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.51,0:30:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.27,0:30:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.18,0:31:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you heard wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.76,0:31:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你个机会 就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna give you one chance … just one …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.54,0:31:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把萨姆还回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hand Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.52,0:31:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.69,0:31:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你逃得过我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think you can run from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.40,0:31:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because when I find you …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.76,0:31:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will find you …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不是完好无损 我就把你拆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he is not in one piece, I will take you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.14,0:31:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.80,0:31:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.31,0:31:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.24,0:32:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.87,0:32:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有她的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.30,0:32:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回地堡 进行追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head back to the bunker, and we'll put a trace on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.60,0:32:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.66,0:32:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她失去意识了 但没有严重损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's unconscious, but there's no serious damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.89,0:32:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那帮帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.29,0:33:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.39,0:33:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该更小心点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手机上有定位服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your location services on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.14,0:33:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的一员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.23,0:33:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.98,0:33:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.85,0:33:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我我弟弟在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me where my brother is,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.93,0:33:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许就不对你下狠手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I might take it easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.70,0:34:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别手软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.20,0:34:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第二轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, round two?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.29,0:34:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.08,0:34:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 我是因为你才死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead. I'm dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.51,0:34:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是因为你才死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.35,0:34:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.02,0:34:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都怪你 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is your fault. - Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.07,0:34:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是因为你才死了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all dead because of you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.99,0:35:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该是你的 本该是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should've been you. It should've been you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.56,0:35:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个怪物 你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a freak. You are a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.93,0:35:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.69,0:35:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.88,0:35:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.69,0:35:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I would've thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.18,0:35:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩这样的壮小伙儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}for two strapping lads like yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.97,0:35:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗力能再强点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would've lasted a tad longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.99,0:35:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 常言说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey, you know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.53,0:35:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good things come to those …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.47,0:36:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你 死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault. Just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.18,0:36:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你 都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault. It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.23,0:36:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你 都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault. It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.62,0:36:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.66,0:36:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不死 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you die, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.79,0:36:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.84,0:36:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.34,0:36:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.54,0:37:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你并不那么擅长你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Maybe you're not as good at your job as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.93,0:37:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.73,0:37:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.92,0:37:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.82,0:37:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.27,0:38:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她车上找到了手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found her cellphone in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.87,0:38:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一通电话是从密苏里州奥尔德里奇打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last phone call was made from Aldrich, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.06,0:38:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆应该在那一带\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're guessing Sam's probably around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.08,0:38:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.65,0:38:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.82,0:38:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在逃避这个 猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my life running from this, from hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.14,0:38:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脱离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.40,0:38:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不希望你和萨姆过这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this for you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.19,0:39:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I-I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.60,0:39:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.67,0:39:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有孩子 也不会希望他们做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had kids, I wouldn't want them in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.26,0:39:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但萨姆和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam and me…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving people and hunting things,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.14,0:39:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.02,0:39:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们让世界更美好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we make the world a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.54,0:39:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.44,0:39:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者称他大汗淋漓 脸色苍白 疯疯癫癫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses say he was sweating and pale and psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.70,0:39:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,自称他是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said his name was freaking Lucifer.
